    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\nAFB13E63612FA2B0292B79CCDC64E368191C4DDC1FF66E9C08B1447684506822E6C08EE7D09E\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\n_No response_\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n0.2.20\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.8.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. Send some files to a contact\n\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nReproducably speed was WAY below possibilities of both sides and file transfer froze or crashed several times\n\nFilesizes where 22gig 8gig 12mb 4mb 4mb\n\n22gig crashed 2 times we gave up then\n8 gig also crashed\n12mb crashed once but worked second time\n4mb both worked.\n\nIn all cases transfer speed was REALLY slow. (1.8mb upload instead of the possible 10mb i have here) download side has 250mbit connection and could load fast from weshare. so problem was not the internet of either parts.\n\nFiletransfering seems quite broken.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nTransfer files at full speed to completion.\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlmost always\n\n### Operating System\n\nWindows\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
